Fantastic job, Tomi!

On Sun 22-Feb-04 at 1729 EST, Tomi Manninen wrote:
> 
> Yes, another beta... I guess I should stop calling these betas as I 
> anyway seem to just keep adding new features. The next one will be
> 0.6, I promise... :)

Parallel support is a very nice addition.  I'm really happy to
now be able to use my laptop's parallel port for PTT and have the
serial port for hamlib use.

Also, I previously mentioned seeing a "protocol error" when
using hamlib with gMFSK and spinning the tuning knob on my
Icom 706 MkIIg.  This has now been cured, even when I give it
a really good spin.  :-)

Thanks, Tomi!  And for anyone who still hasn't tried this great
program, I strongly recommend it.  The features of gMFSK tied
together with hamlib and xlog are unbeatable.

	Mike  AB3AP
